 0|>┌ Keybinds ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐5
 1| │                                                                            │
 2|▌│ Enter                       - ssh to the selected host                     │
 3| │ Esc, Ctrl-C, Ctrl-G, Ctrl-Q - quit (exit 130); Esc closes this help first  │
 4| │ Up, Ctrl-P, Ctrl-K          - select the previous host; wraps to the last  │
 5| │ Down, Ctrl-N, Ctrl-J        - select the next host; wraps to the first     │
 6| │ type                        - filter; 'exact ^prefix suffix$ !not          │
 7| │ Backspace, Ctrl-H           - delete the last character                    │
 8| │ Ctrl-U                      - clear the filter                             │
 9| │ Ctrl-W                      - delete the last word                         │
10| │                                                                            │
11| └ 2 more binds. Make your terminal taller. ──────────────────────────────────┘
